	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Descripsit mihi tui in gratiam, optime compater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>binas epistolas, alteram quidem scriptam ad <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l280">Lausanensis</placeName> scholae professorem, alteram ad d. <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> scholae ministrum <note type="misc">(wer descripsit, fehlt)</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scripsit <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> epistolam t<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>rium foliorum, qua exposuit totam illam suam profectionem; <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ierat enim legatus ad principes <placeName ref="l822">Germanos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>postulatum, ut mitterent oratores ad regem <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> pro <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>captivis supplicatum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Commemorat ergo, quomodo sit exceptus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quidve ei sit responsum, principes videlicet ad regem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>missuros.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">At ignoramus nos, an miserint annon.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Recitat deinde, quomodo <placeName ref="l569">Wormaciam</placeName> deflexerit, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quid ibi cum colloqutoribus evangelicis contulerit, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et quod bona spe sit futurum, ut, si in colloquium con<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>veniamus, concordia iniri possit cum illis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Proinde <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>existimat ille operae precium, si ab illis petamus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>colloquium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Causam sacramentariam ait haerere in his 3 capitibus: <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>1. ipsos asseverare verum corpus Christi coniungi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>cum pane; 2. idque adeo realiter, ut quicunque vel credu<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>li vel increduli panem percipiant, simul etiam corpus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Christi percipiant; 3. clarificati corporis naturam esse <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>eam, ut non circumscribatur, et naturam corporis Christi ex<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>altatam ad dexteram loci non circumscribi, sed esse sim<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ul in coelo, in terra ubique.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ac <persName ref="p458">Brentium</persName> ubiquitatem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>corporis Christi palam asserere, non tamen <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>multos ea in re ei accedere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Mittit insuper <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>confessionem, quam nomine <placeName ref="l832">Gallicanarum</placeName> ecclesiarum obtulit <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>doctis <placeName ref="l569">Wormacię</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Prolixa sunt illa omnia; habes <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>autem, quid ei responderimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Deinde scribit ad <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>me et symmystas suo et symmystarum nomine <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName> sign<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ificans quibusdam spem esse futuri colloquii; quod si <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>habendum sit (quamquam nihil sit adhuc certi) et nos <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>vocemur ad illud, quaerit, an venturi simus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Res<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>pondemus illi, quae vides; ubi autem haec legeris, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>remitte et quidem tuto, ne vel intercidant in <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>itinere vel perveniant in manus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>malignas.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Communi<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>cabis etiam haec cum d. <persName>Philippo</persName>, quem amicissime salu<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>tabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Uterque autem curet, ne haec spargantur, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>denique ut prudenter iis utamini, ne ex his offen<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sio oriatur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l2589">Piccardia</placeName> nihil habemus, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>quod quidam aiunt ibi conflixisse regem infeliciter, alii <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>negant et pernegant; aiunt autem in agro <placeName ref="l150">Ferrariensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>feliciter pugnatum esse a <placeName>Gallicanae</placeName> factionis hominibus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Ego, quid verum sit expecto</foreign>, warten des hinkenden <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>bottens.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Habeo adhuc communicanda quaedam de colloquio <lb xml:id="p1z46"/><placeName ref="l569">Wormatiensi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Des dings ist so vil, das ich nitt wol kan nahin kom<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>men; ich möchte mich schier krum und lam schryben; dann da ist nimmer kein ruͦw.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale una c<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>um amicis et fratribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 14. ianuarii 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro, compatri et fratri meo dilectissimo.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Dem predicanten zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> zuͦ S. Martin h(errn) <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><persName ref="p8009">Hansen Schmid</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
